---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Barefoot shoemaking — Reka Toth"
  description="A developing barefoot-shoemaking portfolio by Reka Toth, exploring movement, materials, repair, and circular footwear."
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-primary">Creative practice</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight max-w-3xl mt-3">
      Barefoot shoemaking
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      A hands-on practice exploring footwear that makes room for movement, honours materials,
      and stays in use for longer. This portfolio is growing alongside an interest in circular footwear.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-display text-xl">1</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mt-5">Health comes first</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">The barefoot approach begins with space, flexibility, and attention to how our feet move.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-display text-xl">2</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mt-5">Material attention</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Material choices, construction, and care are considered as part of a shoe’s whole life.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white p-6">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-display text-xl">3</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mt-5">Keep it in use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">The portfolio will document experiments in custom-minded, circular approaches to footwear.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border px-7 py-9 sm:px-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold">Work in progress</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Case studies, process notes, and finished pairs will appear here as the practice develops.
        For now, this page sets the direction: thoughtful barefoot footwear at the meeting point of craft,
        foot health, and everyday movement.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

